1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:01,876
Atap tangki BBM raksasa ini

2
00:00:01,876 --> 00:00:03,924
tidak ambruk—atap bajanya sengaja

3
00:00:03,924 --> 00:00:05,785
ikut turun saat isinya dipompa

4
00:00:05,785 --> 00:00:06,158
keluar!

5
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:08,238
Pada tangki atap kaku,

6
00:00:08,238 --> 00:00:09,852
ruang kosong di atas cairan

7
00:00:09,852 --> 00:00:11,673
bakal terisi campuran uap BBM

8
00:00:11,673 --> 00:00:13,346
dan udara mudah terbakar.

9
00:00:13,816 --> 00:00:15,551
Karena itu tangki atap apung

10
00:00:15,551 --> 00:00:17,567
dirancang mengambang langsung menempel

11
00:00:17,567 --> 00:00:18,920
di atas permukaan cairan.

12
00:00:19,232 --> 00:00:21,055
Atap berponton ini naik turun

13
00:00:21,055 --> 00:00:23,187
mengikuti isi sambil dirapatkan

14
00:00:23,187 --> 00:00:24,870
segel lentur di dinding agar

15
00:00:24,870 --> 00:00:26,104
ruang uap nyaris hilang.

16
00:00:26,652 --> 00:00:29,147
Desain tiap terminal berbeda antara

17
00:00:29,147 --> 00:00:30,189
atap apung luar,

18
00:00:30,189 --> 00:00:31,895
dalam, maupun tangki tetap.

19
00:00:32,396 --> 00:00:34,380
Oh, jadi atap tangki sengaja

20
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:36,427
mengapung di atas cairan demi

21
00:00:36,427 --> 00:00:38,631
memangkas ruang uap mudah terbakar.

22
00:00:39,186 --> 00:00:40,862
Dulu kamu kira semua atap

23
00:00:40,862 --> 00:00:42,758
tangki putih di pelabuhan itu

24
00:00:42,758 --> 00:00:43,445
dilas mati?

25
00:00:43,445 --> 00:00:43,967
Komen ya,

26
00:00:43,967 --> 00:00:45,423
dan tekan tombol putih di

27
00:00:45,423 --> 00:00:47,071
bawah agar dapat hal-hal yang

28
00:00:47,071 --> 00:00:47,868
nggak disangka!

